@@ -0,0 +1,108 @@
+/*
+    SuperCollider real time audio synthesis system
+    Copyright (c) 2002 James McCartney. All rights reserved.
+    http://www.audiosynth.com
+
+    This program is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify
